1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,871
At every wedding, guests ask the same
question: when do we get the photos?

2
00:00:07,891 --> 00:00:10,082
Usually, they wait days.

3
00:00:10,102 --> 00:00:11,943
With McreatiK Instant Memories,

4
00:00:11,963 --> 00:00:15,005
they see them while the
celebration is still going.

5
00:00:15,025 --> 00:00:17,306
Every moment is live.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,331
You run everything from
one simple dashboard.

7
00:00:21,351 --> 00:00:24,883
Sign in, and every event
you shoot is in one place.

8
00:00:24,903 --> 00:00:28,200
Add your studio name, logo
and WhatsApp number once,

9
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,609
and they appear on every
gallery and printed card.

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,820
Creating an event takes about a minute.

11
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:38,480
Choose Main for weddings, or
Quick for smaller functions,

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,791
add the couple's names and the date.

13
00:00:40,811 --> 00:00:45,695
Then download your studio board and event
cards, with your logo and a QR code,

14
00:00:45,715 --> 00:00:47,738
ready to print for the venue.

15
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:53,768
At the venue, connect your camera to
the uploader on your laptop over Wi-Fi.

16
00:00:53,788 --> 00:00:56,459
One laptop can handle up to four cameras.

17
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:57,913
Then keep shooting.

18
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:02,507
Every photo goes to the gallery
automatically, and if the internet drops,

19
00:01:02,527 --> 00:01:03,733
nothing is lost.

20
00:01:05,433 --> 00:01:07,170
Guests scan the QR code.

21
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:08,468
No app, no sign-up.

22
00:01:08,488 --> 00:01:11,588
The live gallery opens
with your studio's name,

23
00:01:11,608 --> 00:01:14,044
and new photos appear within seconds.

24
00:01:14,064 --> 00:01:18,092
They can view each photo full
screen, like it and download it.

25
00:01:18,112 --> 00:01:21,942
And your WhatsApp and call
buttons are always one tap away,

26
00:01:21,962 --> 00:01:25,033
so every guest can
become your next enquiry.

27
00:01:26,433 --> 00:01:28,594
After the event, upload your edited,

28
00:01:28,614 --> 00:01:31,743
full-quality photos to the
couple's private gallery.

29
00:01:31,763 --> 00:01:34,910
Only the couple sees
these, never the guests.

30
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:37,397
They pick their album photos with one tap,

31
00:01:37,417 --> 00:01:39,767
and download everything in full quality.

32
00:01:39,787 --> 00:01:43,404
You see their choices at
once, ready for album design.

33
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,978
Then see the results.

34
00:01:45,998 --> 00:01:49,639
How many guests visited,
which photos they loved most,

35
00:01:49,659 --> 00:01:51,672
and who asked for an HD photo.

36
00:01:51,692 --> 00:01:54,638
Each request comes with
a WhatsApp or email link,

37
00:01:54,658 --> 00:01:57,944
so it is a possible booking
waiting for your reply.

38
00:01:59,033 --> 00:02:02,831
A Main event is two thousand four
hundred and ninety-nine rupees,

39
00:02:02,851 --> 00:02:06,532
and a Quick event is one thousand
four hundred and ninety-nine.

40
00:02:06,552 --> 00:02:09,217
Monthly packs bring
the price down further.

41
00:02:09,237 --> 00:02:11,654
Let your next event be seen live.

42
00:02:11,674 --> 00:02:13,856
Book your free live demo today.

43
00:02:13,876 --> 00:02:16,163
McreatiK Instant Memories.

44
00:02:16,183 --> 00:02:18,303
Every moment is live.
